sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as harness-team.mjs
    participant Cmd as init
    participant H as harness.mjs
    participant FS as FileSystem

    rect rgb(26, 32, 53)
        Note over User,FS: /harness-init (신규 프로젝트)
        User->>CLI: /harness-init
        CLI->>Cmd: init.run(cwd, flags)
        Cmd->>H: detectStack(cwd)
        H-->>Cmd: stack, language, packageManager
        Cmd->>User: 백업 폴더명 확인 (prompt)
        User-->>Cmd: "harness-backup"
        Cmd->>FS: mkdir(backupDir)
        Cmd->>H: planChanges(ctx)
        H->>H: render(AGENTS/CLAUDE.md.hbs)
        H-->>Cmd: changes[]
        Cmd->>User: diff 미리보기 + 승인
        User-->>Cmd: 확인
        Cmd->>H: applyChanges(changes)
        H->>FS: AGENTS.md (core) 기록
        H->>FS: CLAUDE.md (@AGENTS.md import) 기록
        Cmd->>H: copyStaticAssets
        H->>FS: hooks · rules · skills · docs 복사
        H->>FS: .claude/rules → .cursor/rules 미러링
        Cmd->>FS: clone.sh · symlink.sh · delete.sh 기록
        Cmd-->>User: ✅ 완료
    end

    rect rgb(26, 40, 30)
        Note over User,FS: /harness-init 재실행 (기존 프로젝트 — 예전 apply)
        User->>CLI: /harness-init
        CLI->>Cmd: init.run(cwd, flags)
        Cmd->>FS: readFile(CLAUDE.md)
        FS-->>Cmd: existingContent
        Cmd->>H: mergeMarkdown(existing, template)
        Note over H: 마커 외부 사용자 콘텐츠 보존 · 마커 짝이 안 맞으면 건너뛰고 경고
        H-->>Cmd: mergedContent
        Cmd->>H: deepMergeJson(settings.json)
        Cmd->>H: deepMergeJson(.codex/hooks.json)
        Cmd->>User: diff 미리보기 + 승인
        User-->>Cmd: 확인
        Cmd->>FS: writeFile(CLAUDE.md)
        Cmd-->>User: ✅ 완료
    end
